WEBVTT

00:16.310 --> 00:19.920
<b>Your eyes that look far off
into the distance</b>

00:19.920 --> 00:23.550
<b>They're listening to the voice
within your heart</b>

00:23.550 --> 00:27.550
<b>Embracing a still blue moon</b>

00:30.930 --> 00:34.460
<b>Your strength to keep on running</b>

00:34.460 --> 00:38.130
<b>Will open another new door for you</b>

00:38.130 --> 00:42.090
<b>Illuminate the night that
dawns too soon</b>

00:45.440 --> 00:52.680
<b>Even alone, I want to keep on
believing in you</b>

00:52.680 --> 00:59.960
<b>It's in such a moment that this world
will begin to stir</b>

00:59.960 --> 01:03.630
<b>What should we be searching for?</b>

01:03.630 --> 01:07.230
<b>Send out your soul</b>

01:07.230 --> 01:14.500
<b>We'll meet here again someday,
if that's the truth</b>

01:14.500 --> 01:18.140
<b>What should we fix our gaze upon?</b>

01:18.140 --> 01:24.880
<b>The reality that I reached out
and grabbed with my hand</b>

01:24.880 --> 01:28.650
<b>Let it go, let's believe in it</b>

01:35.390 --> 01:39.630
<b>I'm counting on you people, you know.</b>

01:39.630 --> 01:42.260
<b>I wish you wouldn't disappoint me
so much.</b>

01:44.470 --> 01:48.660
<b>Why are you having such trouble
over a mere Sanzo?</b>

01:51.340 --> 01:54.070
<b>You'd know if you fought
them yourself.</b>

01:54.710 --> 02:01.450
<b>Really? Then you don't mind if
I take a direct hand in this?</b>

02:01.450 --> 02:03.580
<b>You just try it if you can.</b>

02:05.620 --> 02:08.960
<b>Lady Gyokumen Koushu, I was able
to obtain some interesting fruit.</b>

02:08.960 --> 02:10.230
<b>Would you like to try some?</b>

02:10.230 --> 02:10.460
<b>Fruit?
Would you like to try some?</b>

02:10.460 --> 02:11.690
<b>Fruit?</b>

02:18.400 --> 02:20.800
<b>I believe it will serve to wash away</b>

02:20.800 --> 02:23.900
<b>the sourness in your mouth with
a somewhat unique flavor.</b>

02:37.290 --> 02:39.550
<b>I'm starving!</b>

02:39.550 --> 02:42.160
<b>Shut up! We just ate!</b>

02:42.160 --> 02:44.760
<b>That doesn't count as eating!</b>

02:44.760 --> 02:48.960
<b>How troubling, we have no more
food supplies on board.</b>

02:48.960 --> 02:50.500
<b>What?!</b>

02:50.500 --> 02:53.030
<b>Oh, fine, eat this.</b>

02:53.030 --> 02:55.130
<b>What? You're giving it to me?
Thank you!</b>

02:56.870 --> 02:58.840
<b>Gag! What is this?!</b>

02:58.840 --> 02:59.810
<b>Unburnable trash.</b>

02:59.810 --> 03:00.340
<b>You bastard!
Unburnable trash.</b>

03:00.340 --> 03:01.480
<b>You bastard!</b>

03:01.480 --> 03:04.810
<b>It's your fault for being so gullible.</b>

03:04.810 --> 03:06.980
<b>Don't mess with me, you bastard!</b>

03:06.980 --> 03:08.320
<b>How dare you call me a bastard?!</b>

03:08.320 --> 03:08.480
<b>I called you a bastard because
you are a bastard!
How dare you call me a bastard?!</b>

03:08.480 --> 03:10.450
<b>I called you a bastard because
you are a bastard!</b>

03:12.820 --> 03:14.960
<b>I smell something really good!</b>

03:14.960 --> 03:17.160
<b>What? Here?</b>

03:17.160 --> 03:19.290
<b>Never mind, just turn right there!</b>

03:19.290 --> 03:20.760
<b>Uh, okay.</b>

03:21.430 --> 03:24.690
<b>Out for a walk, for a walk!
Oh, how fun!</b>

03:26.800 --> 03:30.360
<b>I'm hungry. I wish there was something
tasty around here.</b>

03:32.510 --> 03:34.670
<b>Lucky! I smell something good!</b>

03:40.920 --> 03:42.880
<b>Mount Manjuu?</b>

03:42.880 --> 03:44.820
<b>What a tasty sounding name.</b>

03:44.820 --> 03:46.910
<b>I wonder if there's something
yummy up there?</b>

03:49.020 --> 03:50.530
<b>Sanzo Party!</b>

03:50.530 --> 03:52.430
<b>Fight! Fight!</b>

03:52.430 --> 03:55.030
<b>What the heck are YOU doing here?!</b>

03:55.030 --> 03:56.500
<b>What about you?!</b>

04:01.500 --> 04:01.700
<b>I'm first!</b>

04:01.700 --> 04:03.570
<b>No, I'm first!
I'm first!</b>

04:05.570 --> 04:09.610
<b>Good grief, those two have the
exact same behavior pattern.</b>

04:09.610 --> 04:13.880
<b>She seems more like Goku's
younger sister than Kougaiji's.</b>

04:15.950 --> 04:17.950
<b>Awesome, what a huge tree!</b>

04:17.950 --> 04:18.720
<b>This is it!</b>

04:18.720 --> 04:19.420
<b>Hey, no fair!
This is it!</b>

04:19.420 --> 04:20.180
<b>Hey, no fair!</b>

04:21.190 --> 04:22.120
<b>Ow!</b>

04:22.120 --> 04:22.690
<b>Ow! This thing stung me!
Ow!</b>

04:22.690 --> 04:25.130
<b>Ow This thing stung me!</b>

04:25.130 --> 04:26.760
<b>What a weird tree.</b>

04:26.760 --> 04:28.190
<b>Oh, well.</b>

04:30.030 --> 04:31.560
<b>This one's rotten.</b>

04:32.630 --> 04:34.100
<b>This one's mine!</b>

04:34.840 --> 04:36.360
<b>Wait, this one too?</b>

04:40.980 --> 04:43.110
<b>Man, what's up with this tree?</b>

04:43.110 --> 04:44.910
<b>They're all rotten!</b>

04:44.910 --> 04:46.780
<b>You idiots!</b>

04:47.920 --> 04:49.250
<b>What'd you do that for?!</b>

04:49.250 --> 04:49.420
<b>Don't you go eating other people's
things without permission!
What'd you do that for?!</b>

04:49.420 --> 04:51.620
<b>Don't you go eating other people's
things without permission!</b>

04:51.620 --> 04:55.520
<b>That's right. You must ask the
people in the temple first.</b>

04:55.520 --> 04:57.890
<b>But I haven't eaten anything yet,</b>

04:57.890 --> 04:59.690
<b>and I feel like I'm about
to starve to death.</b>

04:59.690 --> 05:04.690
<b>Yeah! We tried to eat them,
but they're all rotten!</b>

05:06.670 --> 05:10.070
<b>Damn it, they smell good, but...</b>

05:10.670 --> 05:13.380
<b>Forget about fruit that's
not even edible.</b>

05:13.380 --> 05:15.810
<b>More importantly, isn't anyone home?!</b>

05:16.750 --> 05:19.370
<b>Hello?! Is there anyone here?!</b>

05:24.790 --> 05:26.250
<b>Who is it?</b>

05:26.790 --> 05:31.030
<b>We're travelers, not anyone suspicious.</b>

05:31.030 --> 05:32.360
<b>At least, less so than we look.</b>

05:32.360 --> 05:32.530
<b>Why did you look this way?
At least, less so than we look.</b>

05:32.530 --> 05:34.360
<b>Why did you look this way?</b>

05:34.360 --> 05:36.870
<b>Hey, you got anything to eat?</b>

05:36.870 --> 05:38.530
<b>We're really hungry.</b>

05:39.830 --> 05:42.170
<b>You're travelers?</b>

05:42.170 --> 05:43.870
<b>Twins?</b>

05:43.870 --> 05:46.040
<b>Excuse me, but could it be</b>

05:46.040 --> 05:49.680
<b>that you're the famous Priest Sanzo?</b>

05:49.680 --> 05:51.750
<b>No, you've got the wrong guy.</b>

05:51.750 --> 05:54.580
<b>What? You've got no reason
to hide who you are, Sanzo.</b>

05:54.580 --> 05:56.120
<b>That's right, Sanzo.</b>

05:56.120 --> 05:57.650
<b>I'm going to kill you two.</b>

05:57.650 --> 06:02.890
<b>Now, now, all you have to do is
do something a bit Sanzo-like.</b>

06:02.890 --> 06:05.960
<b>And we won't have to worry
about food or lodgings.</b>

06:05.960 --> 06:07.430
<b>Right, Sanzo?</b>

06:08.600 --> 06:10.060
<b>Not my problem.</b>

06:11.500 --> 06:15.470
<b>I'm an apprentice here at Gosoukan,
and my name's Chinpu.</b>

06:15.470 --> 06:18.870
<b>I'm Mingetsu. Please come in,
Priest Sanzo.</b>

06:18.870 --> 06:20.930
<b>What a pain in the butt.</b>

06:21.740 --> 06:24.810
<b>We have little in the way of hospitality.</b>

06:24.810 --> 06:26.470
<b>But please, help yourselves.</b>

06:28.320 --> 06:29.780
<b>What's this?</b>

06:30.450 --> 06:32.890
<b>They're made of boiled-down
ninjinka seeds.</b>

06:33.860 --> 06:35.890
<b>It's called soukantan.</b>

06:35.890 --> 06:37.950
<b>A couple of them is enough
to make you full.</b>

06:38.530 --> 06:41.320
<b>We have nothing else
we can offer you, so...</b>

06:43.400 --> 06:45.800
<b>Well, if it fills me up,
I don't care what it is.</b>

06:45.800 --> 06:47.600
<b>Thanks for the food!</b>

06:47.600 --> 06:50.110
<b>Hey, don't eat it!</b>

06:50.110 --> 06:51.570
<b>Why not?!</b>

06:52.610 --> 06:55.780
<b>Is there no one else at this temple?</b>

06:55.780 --> 07:00.520
<b>No, our senior disciples are
usually here as well, but...</b>

07:00.520 --> 07:04.780
<b>A month ago, they all left on
a journey with our master.</b>

07:09.890 --> 07:13.290
<b>And you've been watching the
temple alone all this time?</b>

07:13.290 --> 07:14.100
<b>Yes!</b>

07:14.100 --> 07:14.800
<b>I'm surprised you haven't been
attacked by burglars or demons.
Yes!</b>

07:14.800 --> 07:18.160
<b>I'm surprised you haven't been
attacked by burglars or demons.</b>

07:20.400 --> 07:23.510
<b>That's probably because the holy
power of the ninjinka tree</b>

07:23.510 --> 07:25.770
<b>is protecting us.</b>

07:26.540 --> 07:28.780
<b>Speaking of which,
why can't you eat those?</b>

07:28.780 --> 07:30.840
<b>They rotted the second
we touched them.</b>

07:31.610 --> 07:35.280
<b>You can't pick ninjinka
without special tools,</b>

07:35.280 --> 07:37.270
<b>called kingekishi and tanban.</b>

07:37.850 --> 07:40.950
<b>Besides, the ones out there
aren't ripe yet.</b>

07:41.620 --> 07:43.250
<b>Wow, I didn't know that.</b>

07:44.490 --> 07:46.720
<b>We must hurry on our way.
Sorry to have disturbed you.</b>

07:47.300 --> 07:50.930
<b>Hey, Sanzo, are we really
going without eating?</b>

07:50.930 --> 07:51.870
<b>That's right.</b>

07:51.870 --> 07:52.870
<b>But you know...
That's right.</b>

07:52.870 --> 07:53.200
<b>But you kow...</b>

07:53.200 --> 07:54.330
<b>Never mind, let's go!</b>

07:55.540 --> 07:58.670
<b>Well, I'm not in a hurry,
so I'm eating this!</b>

08:00.180 --> 08:01.800
<b>Gag! This tastes like puke!</b>

08:05.510 --> 08:08.420
<b>Bye! See ya later!</b>

08:08.420 --> 08:10.720
<b>What's up with her anyway?</b>

08:10.720 --> 08:11.690
<b>Let's go.</b>

08:11.690 --> 08:12.220
<b>Please wait.
Let's go.</b>

08:12.220 --> 08:13.150
<b>Please wait.</b>

08:14.320 --> 08:16.160
<b>Please take this.</b>

08:16.160 --> 08:18.630
<b>It should ease your hunger a little.</b>

08:18.630 --> 08:21.000
<b>Hey, thank you! You're a great help!</b>

08:21.000 --> 08:24.400
<b>We haven't had guests in so long.
It's unfortunate.</b>

08:24.400 --> 08:27.040
<b>To be honest, we'd have liked you</b>

08:27.040 --> 08:29.740
<b>to stay with us until our
master returned.</b>

08:29.740 --> 08:31.510
<b>Goku, what're you doing?!</b>

08:31.510 --> 08:33.440
<b>Come on, let's go, monkey!</b>

08:33.440 --> 08:34.910
<b>Don't call me a monkey!</b>

08:36.210 --> 08:38.850
<b>Mingetsu, Chinpu, wait here
for a minute!</b>

08:38.850 --> 08:40.380
<b>You sensed it too?</b>

08:40.380 --> 08:42.950
<b>Yeah, they're definitely demons.</b>

08:42.950 --> 08:45.990
<b>What should we do? Shall we
go back and take them out?</b>

08:45.990 --> 08:49.790
<b>You're kidding, right? We're not
champions of justice.</b>

08:49.790 --> 08:52.360
<b>I'd rather avoid any
further involvement.</b>

08:52.360 --> 08:56.060
<b>Hey, Sanzo! They said they're lonely!</b>

08:56.060 --> 08:57.530
<b>Let's go back!</b>

08:58.130 --> 09:01.600
<b>Didn't you think they were
suspicious at all?</b>

09:01.600 --> 09:03.000
<b>What? Why?</b>

09:03.000 --> 09:03.100
<b>They're probably erasing their demon
scent with the ninjinka.
What? Why?</b>

09:03.100 --> 09:07.710
<b>They're probably erasing their demon
scent with the ninjinka.</b>

09:07.710 --> 09:10.750
<b>But they gave me this.</b>

09:10.750 --> 09:12.410
<b>Maybe they're good demons?</b>

09:12.410 --> 09:16.750
<b>Goku, placing too much trust in people
may not be advisable.</b>

09:17.350 --> 09:19.820
<b>Why shouldn't I trust people?</b>

09:19.820 --> 09:22.590
<b>Enough, trying to reason
with him is pointless.</b>

09:22.590 --> 09:25.660
<b>Hey, give that back, Sanzo!
That's mine!</b>

09:25.660 --> 09:28.400
<b>Shut up! Keep your idiocy within limits.</b>

09:28.400 --> 09:31.370
<b>Yeah, sure, I'm an idiot! What's wrong
with being an idiot?!</b>

09:31.370 --> 09:32.130
<b>Damn it!</b>

09:32.130 --> 09:32.870
<b>Hey, Goku where are you going?
Damn it!</b>

09:32.870 --> 09:34.470
<b>Hey, Goku where are you going?</b>

09:34.470 --> 09:38.500
<b>I'm going back! And I'm going
to prove they're innocent!</b>

09:39.040 --> 09:40.740
<b>Wait, Goku!</b>

09:40.740 --> 09:43.110
<b>Hey, are you letting him go, Sanzo?</b>

09:43.110 --> 09:45.980
<b>It's probably useless, no matter
what we say to him.</b>

09:45.980 --> 09:51.280
<b>There are some things you just have
to see with your own eyes.</b>

09:52.750 --> 09:56.990
<b>Fine, I may be an idiot, but
if I can't trust people...</b>

09:59.190 --> 10:01.590
<b>...l'd rather be an idiot!</b>

10:06.200 --> 10:09.570
<b>I don't feel so good.</b>

10:23.690 --> 10:26.380
<b>It was truly good of you to come back.</b>

10:27.760 --> 10:29.220
<b>All right, I'm gonna eat now!</b>

10:32.790 --> 10:34.350
<b>These really taste yucky!</b>

10:35.800 --> 10:37.400
<b>But I'm fine.</b>

10:37.400 --> 10:40.160
<b>Sanzo was the one who
was wrong after all.</b>

10:43.040 --> 10:44.540
<b>He ate it.</b>

10:44.540 --> 10:46.310
<b>Yeah, he ate it.</b>

10:46.310 --> 10:49.780
<b>It's too bad we let Sanzo and
the others get away, but...</b>

10:49.780 --> 10:54.080
<b>It's not a problem. We already
collected his DNA data.</b>

10:55.820 --> 10:57.280
<b>Thanks for the food!</b>

11:01.390 --> 11:02.860
<b>Well, I'll be going now.</b>

11:05.730 --> 11:07.190
<b>What's this?</b>

11:10.800 --> 11:12.490
<b>You guys...</b>

11:16.640 --> 11:19.070
<b>You really were bad guys?</b>

11:25.680 --> 11:27.270
<b>Goku certainly is late.</b>

11:28.020 --> 11:31.380
<b>Damn, we gotta camp out
in a place like this?</b>

11:32.790 --> 11:34.760
<b>I don't mean to imitate Goku,
but I'm hungry.</b>

11:37.430 --> 11:38.890
<b>Hey, look.</b>

11:41.860 --> 11:44.890
<b>I have to go there.
I have to go there.</b>

11:46.200 --> 11:47.670
<b>Lirin, where are you going?</b>

11:49.100 --> 11:50.570
<b>Lirin!</b>

11:56.140 --> 11:58.980
<b>I have to go there.
I have to go there.</b>

11:59.880 --> 12:01.350
<b>What do you make of that?</b>

12:03.450 --> 12:04.920
<b>This is what it means.</b>

12:06.250 --> 12:07.950
<b>Eat this, and that's what
happens to you.</b>

12:11.560 --> 12:13.230
<b>What's going on?</b>

12:13.230 --> 12:18.900
<b>Normally, the ninjinka buds would be
bursting from his body by now.</b>

12:18.900 --> 12:20.970
<b>It's the demon power limiter.</b>

12:20.970 --> 12:24.630
<b>The power of our seeds is also being
suppressed because of it.</b>

12:25.510 --> 12:27.240
<b>Then if we take this off...</b>

12:27.240 --> 12:28.670
<b>Don't touch me!</b>

12:29.340 --> 12:33.910
<b>How dare you trick me?! You'd better
be prepared to pay for it!</b>

12:41.120 --> 12:43.280
<b>It's going to cost you dearly,
you bastards!</b>

12:50.160 --> 12:52.720
<b>I had no idea there was a place
like this behind the mountain.</b>

12:53.300 --> 12:56.870
<b>Sanzo, shouldn't we stop Lirin?</b>

12:56.870 --> 12:58.410
<b>How?</b>

12:58.410 --> 13:00.370
<b>Well...</b>

13:00.370 --> 13:02.680
<b>So those are the roots of the ninjinka.</b>

13:02.680 --> 13:04.140
<b>Hey, take a look.</b>

13:07.180 --> 13:09.240
<b>I see, human bulbs.</b>

13:09.820 --> 13:13.450
<b>The ninjinka is using these
people as fertilizer.</b>

13:14.220 --> 13:16.190
<b>Chinpu and Mingetsu!</b>

13:16.190 --> 13:18.530
<b>Then, those on the mountain were...</b>

13:18.530 --> 13:22.500
<b>Are you by any chance Priest Sanzo?</b>

13:22.500 --> 13:24.070
<b>And you are?</b>

13:24.070 --> 13:27.170
<b>My name is Chingenshi.</b>

13:27.170 --> 13:30.940
<b>I serve as the head of Gosoukan.</b>

13:30.940 --> 13:32.870
<b>Truly impressive.</b>

13:32.870 --> 13:36.780
<b>You've maintained consciousness
even in your current state.</b>

13:36.780 --> 13:39.910
<b>That is sure to end soon.</b>

13:39.910 --> 13:44.540
<b>The ninjinka's powers increase
by the day.</b>

13:45.150 --> 13:46.680
<b>What happened?</b>

13:49.490 --> 13:51.260
<b>What strength.</b>

13:51.260 --> 13:53.390
<b>He doesn't know when to give up!</b>

13:59.230 --> 14:02.100
<b>All right, the effects are finally
beginning to show.</b>

14:03.100 --> 14:08.600
<b>Damn it! I'll beat the crap out of you
before something happens to me!</b>

14:09.340 --> 14:14.180
<b>Various offerings are brought
here, to Gosoukan.</b>

14:14.180 --> 14:19.220
<b>One day, a small sapling was
delivered as an offering.</b>

14:19.220 --> 14:22.190
<b>That was the ninjinka.</b>

14:22.190 --> 14:27.800
<b>It was planted in the yard, and
it grew at a terrifying rate.</b>

14:27.800 --> 14:32.170
<b>We became fearful of it and
decided to ut it down,</b>

14:32.170 --> 14:35.800
<b>but no blade could affect it,
nor could fire.</b>

14:35.800 --> 14:40.540
<b>We stood by helplessly as the
ninjinka bore numerous fruits.</b>

14:40.540 --> 14:45.750
<b>I told my pupils never to eat it,</b>

14:45.750 --> 14:49.720
<b>but Chinpu and Mingetsu
went behind my back</b>

14:49.720 --> 14:52.720
<b>and ate the fruits of the ninjinka.</b>

14:52.720 --> 14:56.160
<b>And then, two fakes, pretending
to be those two</b>

14:56.160 --> 14:59.680
<b>served the ninjinka fruit to us.</b>

15:01.100 --> 15:02.700
<b>You'll defeat us...</b>

15:02.700 --> 15:04.600
<b>...in your current state?</b>

15:04.600 --> 15:07.500
<b>Shut up! Quit scurrying around!</b>

15:08.240 --> 15:10.840
<b>His movements have grown
quite sluggish, but...</b>

15:10.840 --> 15:13.570
<b>It looks like it will still be a while
before he becomes a bulb.</b>

15:14.840 --> 15:17.210
<b>We have no choice. It's still
a little early, but...</b>

15:17.210 --> 15:19.510
<b>We'll just have to use these.</b>

15:19.510 --> 15:20.980
<b>What are those weapons?!</b>

15:21.520 --> 15:23.380
<b>These aren't weapons.</b>

15:23.380 --> 15:24.690
<b>It's the kingekishi...</b>

15:24.690 --> 15:24.890
<b>...and the tanban.
It's the kingekishi...</b>

15:24.890 --> 15:25.850
<b>...and the tanban.</b>

15:25.850 --> 15:27.420
<b>Please wait a moment.</b>

15:27.420 --> 15:30.760
<b>Where did the fake Mingetsu
and Chinpu come from?</b>

15:30.760 --> 15:34.130
<b>They are ninjinka fruits.</b>

15:34.130 --> 15:36.800
<b>In the course of its growth,</b>

15:36.800 --> 15:40.000
<b>the ninjinka steals people's
genetic codes</b>

15:40.000 --> 15:43.400
<b>and is capable of creating clones.</b>

15:45.040 --> 15:47.040
<b>Clones...</b>

15:47.040 --> 15:50.880
<b>Then, when Goku and Lirin were
trying to pick those fruits...</b>

15:50.880 --> 15:55.080
<b>They were being pricked
by the ninjinka's vines.</b>

15:55.080 --> 15:59.250
<b>If that's the case, even he'll have
a tough fight on his hands.</b>

16:02.360 --> 16:04.460
<b>If we had spent a little more time,</b>

16:04.460 --> 16:07.480
<b>she would have been
conscious like us, but...</b>

16:11.670 --> 16:13.800
<b>But her powers are the same
as the real thing!</b>

16:13.800 --> 16:15.500
<b>It will be enough to defeat you!</b>

16:16.740 --> 16:19.330
<b>Weird roots growing out of me,
and I'm hungry to boot!</b>

16:25.310 --> 16:26.750
<b>Bastard!</b>

16:29.780 --> 16:35.720
<b>You idiots! The real one's cuter!</b>

16:41.400 --> 16:42.900
<b>Damn him!</b>

16:42.900 --> 16:45.060
<b>Fine, then we'll settle this
with numbers!</b>

16:54.680 --> 16:56.200
<b>Hey, is this for real?!</b>

16:57.040 --> 17:00.450
<b>Now, can you win against yourself?</b>

17:00.450 --> 17:03.140
<b>Or will you give up and turn
into a bulb-person?</b>

17:08.390 --> 17:10.120
<b>It's finally sprouted.</b>

17:10.120 --> 17:11.430
<b>All right, seize him!</b>

17:11.430 --> 17:11.590
<b>Stop!
All right, seize him!</b>

17:11.590 --> 17:12.890
<b>Stop!</b>

17:17.130 --> 17:20.940
<b>Sheesh, they made so many
of those idiots.</b>

17:20.940 --> 17:24.310
<b>You should think more of the
trouble it'll cause others.</b>

17:24.310 --> 17:27.540
<b>Illegal copies are an infringement
of the copyright.</b>

17:27.540 --> 17:31.200
<b>Sanzo... Gojyo... Hakkai...</b>

17:32.680 --> 17:35.580
<b>We knew you'd come back.</b>

17:35.580 --> 17:38.090
<b>Our true target is you guys.</b>

17:38.090 --> 17:41.120
<b>Which means you're
Kougaiji's assassins?</b>

17:41.120 --> 17:45.090
<b>Lirin has been turned into fertilizer.
That's unlikely.</b>

17:45.090 --> 17:49.330
<b>In that case, the mastermind
behind Kougaiji?</b>

17:49.330 --> 17:53.600
<b>I see. The twisted personalities
seem to point in that direction.</b>

17:54.540 --> 17:55.940
<b>Useless talk.</b>

17:55.940 --> 17:56.040
<b>Get them!
Useless talk.</b>

17:56.040 --> 17:57.400
<b>Get them!</b>

17:58.340 --> 18:00.270
<b>Die! Damn organic waste!</b>

18:04.110 --> 18:07.270
<b>Beating up a gang of the stupid
monkeys feels pretty good!</b>

18:08.580 --> 18:11.450
<b>Please don't mistakenly kill
the real one!</b>

18:13.920 --> 18:17.760
<b>Damn it! They're having fun
defeating me!</b>

18:17.760 --> 18:19.890
<b>It really pisses me off
for some reason!</b>

18:19.890 --> 18:20.960
<b>Why?!</b>

18:20.960 --> 18:21.360
<b>They should have the same
powers as he does!
Why?!</b>

18:21.360 --> 18:23.360
<b>They should have the same
powers as he does!</b>

18:23.360 --> 18:27.030
<b>Don't underestimate us. Make copies
all you want, they're still fruit!</b>

18:27.030 --> 18:29.590
<b>The Son Goku we know...</b>

18:31.810 --> 18:33.270
<b>...is much more stupid.</b>

18:34.310 --> 18:37.310
<b>Next time you take a DNA
sample from Goku,</b>

18:37.310 --> 18:40.380
<b>I suggest you do it when
he's not hunry.</b>

18:40.380 --> 18:44.550
<b>You call these Goku?
They're really bad copies.</b>

18:46.190 --> 18:47.810
<b>Looks like you're out of tricks.</b>

18:51.260 --> 18:52.990
<b>Time to end this game.</b>

18:52.990 --> 18:53.530
<b>Wa...</b>

18:53.530 --> 18:54.500
<b>Wait!
Wa...</b>

18:54.500 --> 18:54.980
<b>Wait!</b>

19:07.140 --> 19:10.950
<b>What the heck? You should've
just done that from the start.</b>

19:10.950 --> 19:13.310
<b>You wouldn't have had
to fight them all.</b>

19:13.310 --> 19:15.370
<b>But that wouldn't have been satisfying.</b>

19:16.050 --> 19:17.520
<b>For you, that is.</b>

19:19.390 --> 19:21.290
<b>Hurry up and finish it.</b>

19:22.660 --> 19:24.290
<b>Listen up, ninjinka!</b>

19:24.290 --> 19:26.920
<b>You really tasted like puke!</b>

19:37.170 --> 19:38.640
<b>Yeah!</b>

19:44.210 --> 19:45.680
<b>We've been saved.</b>

19:46.950 --> 19:50.250
<b>What?! What am I doing here?</b>

19:51.850 --> 19:56.860
<b>We shall be more wary of
offerings from now on.</b>

19:56.860 --> 19:59.530
<b>Thank you so very much.</b>

19:59.530 --> 20:01.760
<b>How could we ever thank you?</b>

20:01.760 --> 20:05.930
<b>You don't have to thank us, but
do you have anything to eat?</b>

20:05.930 --> 20:08.460
<b>Well, if you'd find this acceptable...</b>

20:09.170 --> 20:11.140
<b>Hey, thank you.</b>

20:12.110 --> 20:13.440
<b>Let's go.</b>

20:13.440 --> 20:13.610
<b>Sure!
Let's go.</b>

20:13.610 --> 20:14.940
<b>Sure!</b>

20:17.240 --> 20:18.980
<b>Hey, Sanzo.</b>

20:18.980 --> 20:20.080
<b>What is it?</b>

20:20.080 --> 20:20.950
<b>I'm sorry.
What is it?</b>

20:20.950 --> 20:21.580
<b>I'm sorry.
Why are you apologizing?</b>

20:21.580 --> 20:22.720
<b>Why are you apologizing?</b>

20:22.720 --> 20:25.520
<b>Because I'm stupid.</b>

20:25.520 --> 20:29.390
<b>Don't let it bother you.
You're not the only one.</b>

20:29.390 --> 20:30.760
<b>You got that right.</b>

20:30.760 --> 20:30.890
<b>We wouldn't be on this journey
if we weren't all fools.
You got that right.</b>

20:30.890 --> 20:34.160
<b>We wouldn't be on this journey
if we weren't all fools</b>

20:40.070 --> 20:46.470
<b>That's right, even sudden
tragedies come</b>

20:46.470 --> 20:51.850
<b>Looking good-natured,
without cause for suspicion</b>

20:51.850 --> 20:57.350
<b>Don't complain, just shut u</b>

20:57.350 --> 21:00.750
<b>And look up</b>

21:00.750 --> 21:06.560
<b>I'll stay in character no matter
how ordinary the scene is</b>

21:06.560 --> 21:11.970
<b>Before any talk of dreams or hopes</b>

21:11.970 --> 21:17.300
<b>It's probably the same for everyone</b>

21:17.300 --> 21:21.240
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

21:28.250 --> 21:31.890
<b>The sun sets and a new day comes</b>

21:31.890 --> 21:33.850
<b>Repeating is one change</b>

21:33.850 --> 21:37.960
<b>Don't avert eyes from differences</b>

21:37.960 --> 21:42.100
<b>Your nerve and soul to the limit</b>

21:42.100 --> 21:44.800
<b>Go forward now</b>

21:44.800 --> 21:49.840
<b>Standing next to the taut pressure</b>

21:49.840 --> 21:55.240
<b>I'll laugh more boldly and
fearlessly than anyone</b>

21:55.240 --> 22:00.680
<b>It's probably the same for everyone</b>

22:00.680 --> 22:04.710
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

22:14.800 --> 22:16.160
<b>Next Saiyuki</b>

22:17.300 --> 22:19.470
<b>What the heck is up with Gojyo?</b>

22:19.470 --> 22:22.340
<b>Why's he with such a little girl?</b>

22:22.340 --> 22:25.740
<b>I'm pretty sure he was raring
to go hit on some girls.</b>

22:25.740 --> 22:28.440
<b>He seems like the type who
tends to look after people,</b>

22:28.440 --> 22:30.930
<b>so maybe he's gotten himself
involved in something big?</b>

22:32.350 --> 22:34.850
<b>Next time on Gensou Maden
Saiyuki, "Their Promise"</b>

22:34.850 --> 22:37.180
<b>Next Time
Their Promise
Next time on Gensou Maden
Saiyuki, "Their Promise"</b>

22:37.180 --> 22:38.650
<b>Next Time
Their Promise
You'd do well to watch!</b>
